// Q-081 A job that runs for ever (a game's loop) holds a stopping server for 10 s, then ends as "internal error (a bug in Quillo)"; while it runs, the log says "still running; skipped" every second
// mode: script
// script: steps.sh
// open-when: internal error (a bug in Quillo)
// open-when: /stopped after (9|10|11)\./
// fixed-when: /stopped after [0-2]\./
// From FEEDBACK12.md §Q-081 (found on 6887b0b).

fn game_loop() {
    while true { sleep(50) }
}
schedule("1s", game_loop)
route GET / = "ok"
